本项目为 AI 聊天机器人，所有回复内容由**第三方大语言模型生成**。模型生成内容的准确性、合法性、合规性、真实性或适当性**不在任何保证范围之内**；由此引发的一切后果由使用者自行判断并承担。

This project is an AI chatbot. All replies are **generated by third-party large language models**. The accuracy, legality, compliance, truthfulness, or appropriateness of model-generated content is **not warranted in any respect**; the user shall judge such content independently and bear all consequences arising from it.

